@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed — Coherent Sprint planning, execution and review
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Refine backlog meaning and criteria under current project scope;
:Explicitly select goal, eligible items and delivery plan/tasks;
:Guard and persist one coherent Sprint Backlog;
:Execute work; update task and item observations explicitly;
:Review actual outcomes against identified criteria and goal;
:Record item acceptance and goal outcome by actual authority;
:Close period with exact goal/scope/plan and observed outcomes;
if (Incomplete work remains?) then (yes)
 :Apply only reviewed explicit incomplete-work disposition;
 :Select any future Sprint scope deliberately; no inferred carry-over;
else (no)
 :Preserve actual completion / acceptance evidence;
endif
:Retain closed-period context independently of later item edits;
stop

@enduml
